{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>And your name shall be Abraham.</b> From now on." "<b>For a father of a multitude of nations I have made you.</b> For the significance of this name begins today, since I have already made you a father of a multitude of nations; and therefore <b>your name shall no longer be called Abram</b> at all, forever. But it was not so with the name Israel, for the primary significance of the name Israel was for the future, as will be explained in its place."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:24.343266572Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}